       },
       "description": "Markdown documents: { text, where, kind, heading_kind, display_kind, document_heading_level, document_heading_is_metadata, quote_kind, fields, context_requires_review_rules }. Unresolved quotes and unsupported blocks are coverage problems; sentence-specific check findings on headings, list items, table cells and display text stay uncertain for context review."
