      "cue_narration": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "object", "required": ["text", "profile"] }, "description": "Narration split into cue headings: { text, where, profile: { kind, field?, cue_heading_level, cue_id_pattern, frontmatter?: { fields: { name: string|number }, required? } } }. Each unit keeps its cue_id; quotes, code, lists, text outside a cue, empty or repeated cues and unreadable frontmatter are problems." },
